---
import { terminalStory } from "../scripts/terminal-story";
---
<section class="terminal-demo" id="demo" data-terminal-demo data-reveal>
  <div class="site-shell">
  <header class="cli-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">ProfitCTL in action</p><h2>Watch a margin problem unfold.</h2></div><p>Run the product in your browser. Follow a fictional AI SaaS from healthy margins to higher usage, then compare a cheaper route.</p></header>
  <div class="cli-grid">
    <div class="cli-window">
      <div class="cli-toolbar"><span><i aria-hidden="true" /> profitctl</span></div>
      <pre tabindex="0" aria-label="ProfitCTL command output"><code class="cli-command" data-terminal-command>$ profitctl</code><code data-terminal-output>Watch real commands run against the sample scenarios.
Choose a story step to inspect its result.</code></pre>
      <div class="cli-footer"><span class="cli-state" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-terminal-status>Ready to run</span><span>Real CLI · Fictional inputs</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cli-story"><p class="story-label">One product. Four decisions.</p><ol>{terminalStory.map((step, index) => <li><button type="button" data-terminal-step={index} aria-current={index === 0 ? "step" : "false"}><span class="step-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><span>{step.title}</span><span class="step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></li>)}</ol><p class="story-detail" data-terminal-detail>{terminalStory[0]?.detail}</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="cli-caption">The CLI runs locally with fictional rates. Select a step to hold its result.</p>
  <noscript><p class="cli-caption">Enable JavaScript to run the demo, or install ProfitCtl to run your own scenarios.</p></noscript>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
  import { initializeTerminalDemo } from "../scripts/terminal-demo";
  initializeTerminalDemo();
</script>
<style>
  .terminal-demo { margin: 0 clamp(5px,.65vw,12px); padding-block: clamp(56px,6vw,96px); border-radius: 14px; background: light-dark(#163c31, var(--dark-surface)); color: light-dark(#f0f6ee, var(--dark-text)); scroll-margin-top: 85px; }
  .cli-intro { max-width: 800px; margin-bottom: clamp(28px,3.5vw,54px); }
  .eyebrow, .story-label { color: var(--terminal-accent); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; }
  h2 { margin-top: 15px; font-size: clamp(36px,5.4vw,79px); line-height: 1.01; font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: -.026em; word-spacing: .04em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .cli-intro > p { max-width: 60ch; margin-top: 19px; color: light-dark(#d1dfd3, var(--dark-muted)); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .cli-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(250px,.8fr); gap: clamp(28px,6vw,94px); align-items: start; }
  .cli-window { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid light-dark(#688276, var(--dark-line-strong)); border-radius: 5px; background: var(--terminal-surface); color: light-dark(#f2f8ed, var(--dark-text)); }
  .cli-toolbar, .cli-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; color: light-dark(#ceded0, var(--dark-muted)); font-size: 13px; }
  .cli-toolbar { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--terminal-rule); }
  .cli-toolbar > span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-weight: 600; }
  .cli-toolbar i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--terminal-accent); }
  pre { height: 340px; margin: 0; padding: 20px; overflow: auto; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; tab-size: 4; }
  .cli-command { display: block; margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--terminal-accent); }
  .cli-footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--terminal-rule); }
  .cli-state { color: var(--terminal-accent); }
  [data-state=risk] .cli-state, [data-state=error] .cli-state { color: #ffc9aa; }
  .story-label { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid light-dark(#648072, var(--dark-line)); }
  li { border-bottom: 1px solid light-dark(#648072, var(--dark-line)); }
  li button { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; width: 100%; min-height: 58px; padding: 12px 5px; border: 0; color: light-dark(#d1dfd3, var(--dark-muted)); background: transparent; text-align: left; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; }
  li button[aria-current=step] { color: var(--terminal-accent); font-weight: 600; }
  li button:hover { color: white; }
  li button:focus-visible, pre:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--terminal-accent); outline-offset: -3px; }
  .step-index { width: 26px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; }
  .step-arrow { margin-left: auto; }
  .story-detail, .cli-caption { color: light-dark(#d1dfd3, var(--dark-muted)); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .story-detail { margin-top: 21px; }
  .cli-caption { max-width: 78ch; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  @media (max-width:760px) {
    .cli-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 26px; }
    pre { height: 295px; padding: 14px; }
  }
</style>
